Gated DeltaNet NKI kernels — provenance & license
=================================================

The kernel source vendored under ``gdn_src/`` (constants.py and
nki_kernels/*.py) is harvested verbatim from:

    repo    : kernels/jburtoft/qwen35-deltanet-tkg-full  (HuggingFace)
    revision: v4
    license : Apache-2.0

The source repository's README declares: "Custom NKI kernels: original work in
this repo family, published under Apache 2.0." and "License: Apache 2.0." No
standalone LICENSE file ships in that repo; the Apache-2.0 grant is asserted in
its README front-matter (``license: apache-2.0``) and License section. The files
are reproduced here unmodified except for ``gdn_src/nki_kernels/__init__.py``,
which was reduced to a bare package marker so the adapter can lazily import a
single kernel submodule without eagerly importing all seven (a packaging shim;
kernel bodies are untouched).

Registration mode: vendored (Apache-2.0). See kernel.json ``notes`` for the
on-device validation record.
